 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nSchwarzwald Medizintechnik AG                 MASTER SERVICES\n                                              AGREEMENT\nBerliner Allee 19, 70173 Stuttgart, Germany\nUSt-IdNr: DE451274281\nReg No: DE-668872\n\nVON                                           RECHNUNGSADRESSE\nSchwarzwald Medizintechnik AG                 Rheinland Logistik GmbH\nBerliner Allee 19                             Berliner Allee 19\n70173 Stuttgart                               20095 Hamburg\nGermany                                       Germany\nVAT: DE451274281\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 14.02.2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\"), by and between Schwarzwald Medizintechnik AG, with its registered office at Berliner Allee 19,\nStuttgart (\"Party A\"), and Rheinland Logistik GmbH, with its registered office at Berliner Allee 19,\nHamburg (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A   Schwarzwald Medizintechnik AG / Jürgen Hoffmann\nParty B   Rheinland Logistik GmbH / Hans Schneider\nDate      14.02.2026",
